{"seq":472,"elapsed_ms":3942,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"We need answer only DUT between [BEGIN] and [DONE]. Need implement TopModule decade counter with synchronous reset high, slowena pause. SystemVerilog. Need exact syntax. We can provide module with always_ff @(posedge clk). q 4-bit output. Reset synchronous active high: if reset q<=0; else if slowena begin if q==4'd9 q<=0; else q<=q+1; end. Need ensure output reg? SystemVerilog output q logic [3:0], declare output logic [3:0] q or output reg [3:0] q. In SV module top. Let's produce clean.\n\nNeed consider reset overrides slowena. Yes.\n\nWe must return exactly one complete DUT between [BEGIN] and [DONE], no explanation. So:\n\n[BEGIN]\nmodule TopModule(\n    input logic clk,\n    input logic reset,\n    input logic slowena,\n    output logic [3:0] q\n);\n    always_ff @(posedge clk) begin\n        if (reset)\n            q <= 4'd0;\n        else if (slowena) begin\n            if (q == 4'd9)\n                q <= 4'd0;\n            else\n                q <= q + 4'd1;\n        end\n    end\nendmodule\n[DONE]\n\nCheck interface says all input output ports one bit unless otherwise specified. q is 4 bits. This works. Use non-ANSI? ANSI okay. SystemVerilog. Single module. No includes. No DPI. No reset synchrony? always_ff with posedge clk only. Good.\n\nNeed no explanation."}}}
